1. A display device comprising:  
a display panel;  
a rear frame disposed behind the display panel;  
a substrate supported by the rear frame;  
a plurality of light sources mounted on the substrate and configured to emit light toward the display panel; and  
a reflecting sheet disposed between the substrate and the display panel, the reflecting sheet including a plurality of light-absorbing dots,  
wherein a size of the light-absorbing dots increases as a distance of the light-absorbing dots from a corner of the reflecting sheet increases.

1. A display apparatus comprising:  
a display panel;  
a frame including a bottom portion and a sidewall extending from the bottom portion and surrounding the display panel;  
a light-source substrate disposed between the bottom portion and the display panel; and  
a reflecting sheet disposed between the light-source substrate and the display panel, the reflecting sheet including a first reflecting-sheet portion and a second reflecting-sheet portion joined to the first reflecting-sheet portion, each of the first and second reflecting-sheet portions having a plurality of reflective dots arranged in longitudinal and transverse directions, wherein sizes of the reflective dots increase along each of the longitudinal and transverse directions.
